in the summary section.\" .\n\n:BusinessProcess a owl:Class ;\n    rdfs:label \"Business Process\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"A business process to which the invoice can be assigned.\" .\n\n:ValidationConstraint a owl:Class ;\n    rdfs:label \"Validation Constraint\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"A constraint used for SHACL validation of invoice data.\" .\n\n:P2PConcept a owl:Class ;\n    rdfs:label \"P2P-O Concept\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"A concept from the Purchase-to-Pay Ontology (P2P-O).\" .\n\n#################################################################\n# Object Properties\n#################################################################\n:containsMessage a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :InterchangeEnvelope ;\n    rdfs:range :Message ;\n    rdfs:label \"contains message\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Relates an envelope to its contained message.\" .\n\n:hasSegment a owl:ObjectProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :Message ;\n    rdfs:range :Segment ;\n    rdfs:label \"has segment\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Relates a message to its segments.\" .\n\n:hasHeaderSection a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\n    rdfs:range :HeaderSection ;\n    rdfs:label \"has header section\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Relates an invoice message to its header section.\" .\n\n:hasDetailSection a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\n    rdfs:range :DetailSection ;\n    rdfs:label \"has detail section\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Relates an invoice message to its detail section.\" .\n\n:hasSummarySection a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\n    rdfs:range :SummarySection ;\n    rdfs:label \"has summary section\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Relates an invoice message to its summary section.\" .\n\n:hasCompositeElement a owl:ObjectProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :Segment ;\n    rdfs:range :CompositeDataElement ;\n    rdfs:label \"has composite element\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Relates a segment to its composite data elements.\" .\n\n:hasSimpleElement a owl:ObjectProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :CompositeDataElement ;\n    rdfs:range :SimpleDataElement ;\n    rdfs:label \"has simple element\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Relates a composite element to its simple data elements.\" .\n\n:playsRole a owl:ObjectProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :Organization ;\n    rdfs:range :OrganizationRoleAssignment ;\n    rdfs:label \"plays role assignment\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Links an organization to its role assignments.\" .\n\n:hasRole a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :OrganizationRoleAssignment ;\n    rdfs:range :AgentRole ;\n    rdfs:label \"has role\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Links a role assignment to an agent role (e.g., Buyer, Supplier).\" .\n\n:inContextOfInvoice a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :OrganizationRoleAssignment ;\n    rdfs:range :InvoiceMessage ;\n    rdfs:label \"in context of invoice\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Links a role assignment to its invoice message context.\" .\n\n:hasAddress a owl:ObjectProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :Organization ;\n    rdfs:range :Address ;\n    rdfs:label \"has address\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Links an organization to its address.\" .\n\n:hasIdentifier a owl:ObjectProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :Organization ;\n    rdfs:range :Identifier ;\n    rdfs:label \"has identifier\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Links an organization to its identifiers (e.g., GLN).\" .\n\n:hasLineItem a owl:ObjectProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :DetailSection ;\n    rdfs:range :LineItem ;\n    rdfs:label \"has line item\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Links a detail section to its line items.\" .\n\n:describesItem a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :LineItem ;\n    rdfs:range :Item ;\n    rdfs:label \"describes item\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Links a line item to the described item.\" .\n\n:hasNetPrice a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :LineItem ;\n    rdfs:range :Price ;\n    rdfs:label \"has net price\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Links a line item to its net price.\" .\n\n:hasTax a owl:ObjectProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :SummarySection ;\n    rdfs:range :Tax ;\n    rdfs:label \"has tax\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Links a summary section to its taxes.\" .\n\n:hasInvoiceAmount a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :SummarySection ;\n    rdfs:range :Price ;\n    rdfs:label \"has invoice amount\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Links a summary section to the invoice total amount.\" .\n\n:isAssignedToBusinessProcess a owl:ObjectProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\n    rdfs:range :BusinessProcess ;\n    rdfs:label \"is assigned to business process\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Links an invoice message to a business process.\" .\n\n:isValidatedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :InvoiceMessage ;\n    rdfs:range :ValidationConstraint ;\n    rdfs:label \"is validated by\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Links an invoice message to a validation constraint (e.g., SHACL).\" .\n\n:p2pEquivalent a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :P2PConcept ;\n    rdfs:range owl:Thing ;\n    rdfs:label \"P2P-O equivalent\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Indicates the equivalent P2P-O concept.\" .\n\n#################################################################\n# Data Properties\n#################################################################\n:hasGLN a owl:DatatypeProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :GlobalLocationNumber ;\n    rdfs:range xsd:string ;\n    rdfs:label \"has GLN\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"The GLN string value for an organization.\" .\n\n:hasInvoiceNumber a owl:DatatypeProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :BGMSegment ;\n    rdfs:range xsd:string ;\n    rdfs:label \"has invoice number\" ;\n    rdfs:comment \"Invoice number as found in BGM segment.\" .\n\n:hasDocumentDate a owl:DatatypeProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;\n    rdfs:domain :HeaderSection ;\n